<title>MALAYSIA: Aokam Perdana year net loss.</title>
<headline>Aokam Perdana year net loss.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>			(in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net loss		   144.73	 vs   profit  47.04</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents) loss  72.0	  vs   profit  24.2</p>
<p>    Turnover		  165.65	 vs	   249.65</p>
<p>    Pre-tax loss	    145.07	 vs  profit  45.68</p>
<p>    Minorities		0.36	   vs	     0.005</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	 nil	    vs  loss    11.31</p>
<p>    Dividend		  nil	    vs  (cents)  1.75</p>
<p>NOTE: Company's full name is Aokam Perdana Bhd. Its operations include logging.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 230 8911)</p>
</text>
